WEBVTT

00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:09.730
So she's steppin' off the ship for good...
Don't ya think that's too out of the blue?

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:12.110
Seriously, what's up with that?

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:18.280
How could she just leave a note and go off
without saying a word to us?

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:25.370
Why... Katalina?

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:37.210
<i>I know that you two will get there.
To Estalucia, the Island of the Astrals,</i>

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:40.550
<i>and beyond that,
wherever you want to go.</i>

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:47.180
Hey, what are we gonna do?

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.310
Let's go look for Katalina.

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:58.940
We'll ask her face-to-face.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:08.830
I want to hear about it, too.
From Katalina herself!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:12.040
I mean, we could look for her...

00:03:12.710 --> 00:03:15.130
But she might've already left the island.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:21.340
We might find something out from Vira.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:27.470
She's the Lord Commander of this island
and seemed to know Katalina well.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:31.270
Then it's settled. Let's get going!

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:32.100
Right!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:38.320
Hey, Gran, can I leave Katalina to you?

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.440
I'm headin' back to the Grandcypher.

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:41.900
The Grandcypher?

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:44.280
Something's been buggin' me.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:45.570
Oh...

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:49.200
<i>Why the long face?</i>

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.710
<i>That the one the pipsqueak general came on?</i>

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:04.760
<i>Hard to believe he'd stick around
with the negotiations wrapped up.</i>

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:09.270
In that case, count me in, too.

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:12.020
Understood.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.400
Let's hope I'm worrying for nothin'.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:24.160
Not happening.
If I say no, I mean no!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:26.160
All right, get out of here.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:28.830
You're mean!

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:34.170
I can't believe they won't let us see Vira.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:37.330
Turnin' us away at the door,
what's the deal with that?

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.550
Totally different from
how they treated us yesterday!

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.420
What should we do, Gran?

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:43.420
I knew something was up.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:46.930
After we arrived in Albion,

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:50.930
I saw that something was
a little off about Katalina.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:55.190
But I couldn't say a single word to her.

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:04.150
We've got to hurry.
I'm getting a bad feeling about this.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:06.410
Gran...

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:10.530
Vyrn!

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.500
Can you do us a favor?

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.670
Whoa! What are we gonna do?!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.170
It's the Appleman!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:23.670
The Appleman's gotten huge and he's
gobblin' up all the apples in town!

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.340
Oh, man, this is bad!

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:26.550
Apple... man?

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:28.470
Soon there won't be a single apple
left in the city!

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:28.470
What's that?

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.310
What the heck? You don't know?

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.350
It's got these unbelievable fangs...

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:42.860
It's really huge in size and super fierce!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.450
Hey, get back here!

00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:49.240
Sorry, guys!

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.830
The Grandcypher crew?

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:56.750
Yes. The captain and two crew members
have infiltrated the castle.

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.580
I cannot allow them to interrupt
such an important ritual.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.340
Deal with them immediately.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.500
Understood.

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:09.970
<i>This is happening all because
the empire's dragging its feet.</i>

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:12.510
Vira?

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:14.930
Katalina.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:19.400
There seems to be some kind of commotion.
Is something going on?

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.110
Oh, no. We're just preparing for the ritual.

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:27.780
There's nothing for you to worry about.

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:28.650
All right...

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.820
Please go and relax in your room.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:56.560
That's a lot of soldiers they have on hand.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.810
Looks like things won't be so easy.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.810
Since she's the Lord Commander,
she should be upstairs...

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:05.690
Where have you been?

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:09.570
I was told by Lady Vira
to bring Lady Katalina some tea.

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:11.450
K-Katalina? She's here, then?

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:17.370
Capture the infiltrators at once.
Don't let them go any higher than this floor.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:20.330
Whatever you do,
don't them near Lady Katalina.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:21.170
Yes, sir!

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.840
We need to capture them before the ritual—

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.710
Tell us what's going on.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:33.140
Don't worry! As long as you start talking,
we won't do a thing to you.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:36.470
What?

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:40.850
Allow the empire to use
the primal beast Luminiera as a weapon?

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:44.360
That was their condition for letting us go free?

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:45.730
Yes, that's right.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.610
But how could they...

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:49.490
I thought it was fishy!

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:52.740
The empire backing off without a fight like that.

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:55.120
They had this backroom deal in place, huh?

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:58.830
So? What's Katalina doing here?

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:05.080
Lady Katalina is preparing
to offer herself to Albion.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.920
That is, sacrifice herself for your sake.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:12.050
What's that supposed to mean?

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:12.880
There they are!

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:18.890
Take them into custody!

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:23.440
Leave this to me! You guys run!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:24.270
But...

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.440
Bring Katalina back no matter what, okay?

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:31.190
Come on!

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:33.400
Come back here!

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:51.300
Gran!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:55.590
So you were the ones causing the commotion.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.560
Albion's Lord Commander is pressing us again.

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:05.440
She wants us to take immediate action
as per our agreement.

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:07.690
How many times is she up to now?

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:09.940
We're all set to go.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:13.030
Should we open fire
on the Grandcypher as promised?

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:19.740
I'll tell you when I'm ready,
so shut up, moron!

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:19.740
Sir!

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:25.330
She's really chomping at the bit.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.960
Looks like the fun's gonna start early.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.760
Well, whatever the result...

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.340
We're ready.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.600
We heard all about it.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:51.020
That the condition for letting us go free

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:55.190
was to allow the empire
to use Albion's primal beast as a weapon.

00:09:56.110 --> 00:10:00.370
And that you're sacrificing yourself for us.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:03.740
I see...

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:09.080
I was hoping that you'd set off
without ever finding out about that.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.790
What did they mean by sacrifice?

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:16.840
Come with us, Katalina.

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:19.050
You can't sacrifice yourself for us.

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:22.050
He's right! That's definitely a bad idea!

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:25.270
Katalina...

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:31.770
I didn't make this decision just for your sake.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.190
It's also for Vira's sake.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.690
For Vira?

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:40.660
What do you mean by that?

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:44.910
Katalina!

00:10:57.510 --> 00:11:00.340
<i>The year that I turned fifteen,</i>

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:03.640
<i>I enrolled at the Albion Military Academy.</i>

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:07.180
<i>To become a great knight...</i>

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:10.060
<i>To fight to protect the weak...</i>

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:15.230
<i>That was my goal, as well as my dream.</i>

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:22.870
<i>But then something completely unexpected happened.</i>

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:27.450
<i>Albion's Lord Commander at the time
fell ill and passed away suddenly.</i>

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.920
A succession tournament?

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:37.300
The winner shall become
the next Lord Commander of Albion

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:43.010
and fulfill their responsibilities
of ruling Albion without ever leaving this land again.

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:48.100
Alongside the primal beast Luminiera.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:54.610
The final match will most likely be
between you and Vira.

00:11:54.860 --> 00:12:01.150
And it's clear to everyone
that your skills are superior.

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.410
You're going to win.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:07.580
Are you telling me to live not as a knight,
but as Lord Commander?

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:11.830
I've undergone all this training
in order to become a knight—

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:15.330
This is a great honor, Katalina.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.590
We all have high hopes for you.

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:30.060
The succession tournament will now begin!

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:35.690
<i>Ever since I was a child,
I'd dreamed of becoming a knight.</i>

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:44.570
<i>I wanted to use my sword
to protect and save the weak.</i>

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:48.530
<i>For those without a voice,</i>

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:51.750
<i>for those in agony who cannot but tremble,</i>

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:55.620
<i>I wanted to become a knight, and...</i>

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:03.880
<i>If I were to become Lord Commander,</i>

00:13:03.880 --> 00:13:06.890
<i>it would mean the end of my dream
of becoming a knight.</i>

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:09.600
<i>And...</i>

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.600
<i>Before I could find the answer...</i>

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.680
<i>I found myself at the final match.</i>

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:19.020
<i>It was a neck-and-neck battle.</i>

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:26.570
<i>It's true that, in terms of technique,
I may have been a cut above Vira.</i>

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:33.250
<i>But that day, Vira's sword was brimming
with an almost terrifying intensity.</i>

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:15.250
And the winner is Vira Lillie!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:38.850
Katalina...

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:44.400
Go and do as you please.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:15:01.920
<i>And so I became a knight, just as I'd wished,
while Vira became Lord Commander of Albion.</i>

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:09.010
But now, Vira and Luminiera's bond
has been broken.

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:13.970
No matter how many times Vira summons her,
Luminiera refuses to answer.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:19.190
The pressure and loneliness
of being Lord Commander...

00:15:20.900 --> 00:15:23.860
Vira's soul has reached its breaking point.

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.150
It's all my fault.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:30.110
I made Vira shoulder the burden that day.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:35.990
It was my hesitation and weakness
that forced her to make that sacrifice.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:44.710
You know how Katalina didn't tell us
she'd studied at the academy here?

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.340
Yeah.

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:48.710
Maybe it's related to all of this.

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.680
To why she's leavin' us.

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:55.390
Everyone's got a past.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:16:01.560
And sometimes,
we all have to face up to that past.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:09.400
I can't go off and live a life of freedom
after letting Vira take the fall for me.

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:15.660
I'm going to help Vira here in Albion.

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:19.040
I will take her place as Luminiera's new master.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.500
N-No...

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:26.840
Katalina, just hold on a minute!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.050
Stop right there.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:35.590
Katalina has made up her mind.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:38.850
Please don't thwart her.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:43.890
Io!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:49.820
To become Luminiera's master,
and to take over as Lord Commander of Albion...

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:52.990
That is what Katalina has decided to do.

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:59.080
Luminiera serves only her master,

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:04.710
and due to Luminiera's restrictions,
her master can never leave Albion.

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:10.130
Even if it means joining forces with the empire,

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:13.510
she will never become a weapon
that might endanger other nations.

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:19.100
In fact, we should also be able to prevent
the empire from taking advantage of Luminiera.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:20.850
B-But...

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:25.390
Needless to say, as former Lord Commander,
I, too, shall take responsibility

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:27.810
and do all that I can for Albion.

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:36.780
This way, you'll be free to continue your journey
without the empire in pursuit.

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.370
Across the neverending skies...

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:39.780
Freely.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:45.210
This is the best solution, Gran.

00:17:45.460 --> 00:17:49.000
But what about Lyria?
What about her?

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:01.850
Katalina!

00:18:09.020 --> 00:18:10.110
Gran...

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:14.490
Lyria has you. She has her friends.

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:19.870
That's why I was able to reach this decision.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:25.660
Even if I'm not with you, Lyria...
You'll be fine.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.500
Katalina...

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:38.180
But... But!

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:43.010
We have an important ritual to hold,
so please excuse us.

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:44.890
Come, Katalina.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.060
Wait! Katalina!

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:53.860
Katalina!

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:54.730
Katalina!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:55.860
Katalina!

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.910
Katalina!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:16.300
Hey! Whaddya think you're doing?

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:19.930
Katalina...

00:19:23.260 --> 00:19:24.260
Why?

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:29.480
As usual...

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:32.560
I see you've gotten yourselves
mixed up in some trouble.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:34.400
Rosetta!

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:41.530
So that's why you were expelled
from the castle.

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:42.950
Yes.

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:46.080
Well, in that case...

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:50.080
Maybe the best thing to do would be to leave.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:55.630
After all, you're finally free, and the empire
won't be coming after you anymore.

00:19:56.380 --> 00:20:00.840
You shouldn't stay here
and expose everyone to danger.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:02.970
Wouldn't you agree?

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:07.180
If anything should happen to you,
Katalina's sacrifice will have been for nothing.

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:11.600
The last thing we want is for her
to sacrifice herself for us!

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:16.360
But the reason Katalina's choosing
to become Luminiera's master...

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.610
It's for the sake of Vira as well, isn't it?

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:25.620
I want to be with Katalina forever.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:33.920
But if Katalina wants to stay in Albion,
then maybe I'm being selfish.

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:35.920
Lyria...

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:41.340
We can't let this go.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.430
Let's cancel our agreement with the empire.

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:48.430
If we do, there'll be no need
for Katalina to take over Luminiera.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:50.770
Hey, are you serious?

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:54.480
Having someone else sacrifice themself
so we can travel freely...

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:56.020
There's no way I can do that!

00:20:56.980 --> 00:21:00.230
Lyria, you've got to tell Katalina how you feel.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:07.870
Then if Katalina still says
that she wants to stay here...

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.740
If that's what she wants...

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.000
Then we'll accept it.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:22.840
I see.

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:28.260
If that's how you feel,
then I think you should follow your heart.

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:35.350
Let's go!

00:23:23.790 --> 00:23:26.010
U-Um...

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:40.060
EPISODE 4
UNCONVEYABLE FEELINGS

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:38.770
Next episode, "Unconveyable Feelings."
